  "body": "[Hit Regions](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#hit-regions) adds `region` to `MouseEvent`, `MouseEventInit` and `Touch` but not `TouchInit` (probably because `TouchInit` was only [recently standardized](https://w3c.github.io/touch-events/#dictionary-touchinit-members)).   This means there's no defined way for to create an event that uses this feature from JS.\n",
